# /about absorbed the old homepage About section plus the /now and
# /uses pages; those URLs land on their sections. /aboutme is an old
# About URL still linked from a post body.
# The ! forces the redirect even though Astro emits static meta-refresh
# pages at these paths (which would otherwise shadow the 301).
/aboutme  /about/       301!
/aboutme/ /about/       301!
/uses     /about/#uses  301!
/uses/    /about/#uses  301!
/now      /about/#now   301!
/now/     /about/#now   301!
